   "properties": {},
   "title": "Start here",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## LSDub 4: Make Your Character Sing\n**Does:** a song + a character image -> a video of the character singing it: vocal split, lead vocal, alignment, an LTX-2.5 performance as long as the song, a lip kit from it, the dub, Verify (the sync score) and the saved video with the song.\n\n**Needs:** a big GPU (or backend = comfy_cloud), the generator models and the Mel-Band RoFormer vocal checkpoint in models/audio_separation (README).\n\n**Time:** about 30-40 min on a 96 GB card for the 15 s demo song (\"About That Time\", an ACE-Step song of ours).\n\n**Change:** *Load Audio* (your song), *Load Image* (your character), *LSDub Performance* prompt, *LSDub Lyrics*."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
